#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kde; Help System Handbook"
msgstr "&kde; Sistemska pomoć Priručnik"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kde; Help System"
msgstr "&kde;Sistemska pomoć"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &kde; help system is designed to make accessing the common &UNIX; help "
"systems (<application>man</application> and <application>info</application>) "
"simple, as well as the native &kde; documentation (&XML;)."
msgstr ""
"&kde; sistem za pomoć je dizajniran da ućini pristup običnom &UNIX; sistemu "
"pomoći  (<application>man</application> and <application>info</application>) "
"jednostavnim, kao i baznoj &kde; dokumentaciji (&XML;)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All base &kde; applications come fully documented, thanks to the efforts of "
"the Documentation team. If you are interested in helping with the "
"documentation efforts, join the <ulink url=\"https://mail.kde.org/mailman/"
"listinfo/kde-doc-english\">mailing list</ulink> and write to the team at "
"<email>kde-doc-english@kde.org</email>. No experience is required, just "
"enthusiasm and patience."
msgstr ""
"Sve baze &kde; aplikacije su potpuno dokumentovane, zahvaljujući timu za "
"dokumentaciju. Ako želite pomoći pridružite se na <ulink url=\"https://mail."
"kde.org/mailman/listinfo/kde-doc-english\">mailing list</ulink> ili pišite "
"timu na <email>kde-doc-english@kde.org</email>. Iskustvo nije potrebno, samo "
"entuzijazam i strpljenje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you would like to help translating &kde; documentation to your native "
"language, review the information, including coordinators for each language "
"team, on the <ulink url=\"http://l10n.kde.org\">Localization web site</"
"ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite pomoći oko prevođenja &kde; dokumentacije na maternji jezik, "
"pogledajte informacije i upute za svaki tim prevodilaca, na <ulink url="
"\"http://l10n.kde.org\">Localization web site</ulink>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Instalacija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&khelpcenter; is an integral part of the &kde; Base installation, and is "
"installed with every copy of &kde;. It can be found in the kdebase-runtime "
"package, and is available from the &kde-ftp;, or will be found in your "
"operating system's kdebase-runtime package."
msgstr ""
"&khelpcenter; je sastavni dio &kde; Bazne instalacije, i instalira se sa "
"svakom kopijom &kde;. Možete ga pronaći u kdebase-runtime paketu, i dostupan "
"je sa &kde-ftp;, ili se nalazi u vašem sistemskom  kdebase-runtime paketu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "Invoking Help"
msgstr "Traženje pomoći"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "&khelpcenter; can be called in several ways:"
msgstr "&khelpcenter; se može pozvati na nekoliko načina:"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid "From the <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu"
msgstr "Sa <guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> menija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The most common will probably be from within an application. Choose "
"<menuchoice> <shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\"><keycap>F1</keycap></"
"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu>Help</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem><replaceable>Application</replaceable> Handbook</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> to open that application's handbook."
msgstr ""
"Najčešće je vjerovatno iz same aplikacije. Izaberite <menuchoice> <shortcut> "
"<keycombo action=\"simul\"><keycap>F1</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> <guimenuitem><replaceable>Aplikacija</replaceable> "
"Priručnik</guimenuitem></menuchoice> da otvorite aplikacijski priručnik."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid "From the Kickoff Application Launcher"
msgstr "Sa  Kickoff Aplikacijskog Pokretača"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose the big <guiicon>K</guiicon> in your panel, and select the "
"<guimenuitem>Applications</guimenuitem> tab followed by selecting "
"<guimenuitem>Help</guimenuitem> to open &khelpcenter;, which will open up to "
"the default start page."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite veliku <guiicon>K</guiicon> na vašem panelu i odaberite "
"<guimenuitem>Aplikacije</guimenuitem>teb poslije odabira <guimenuitem>Pomoć</"
"guimenuitem> da otvorite &khelpcenter;, koji će se otvoriti na početnoj "
"stranici."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid "From the command line"
msgstr "Sa komandne linije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&khelpcenter; may be started using a &URL; to display a file. &URL;s have "
"been added for <command>info</command> and <command>man</command> pages "
"also. You can use them as follows:"
msgstr ""
"&khelpcenter; možete pokrenuti koristeći &URL; da prikažete fajl. &URL;i su "
"dodani sa <command>info</command> i <command>man</command> stranica također. "
"Ovako ih možete koristiti:"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "An application help file"
msgstr "Aplikacijski Pomoć fajl"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>khelpcenter</command> <option>help:/<replaceable>kwrite</"
"replaceable></option>"
msgstr ""
"<command>khelpcenter</command> <option>help:/<replaceable>kwrite</"
"replaceable></option>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opens the &kwrite; help file, at the contents page."
msgstr "Otvara &kwrite; pomoć fajl, na stranici sa sadržajem."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid "A local &URL;"
msgstr "Lokalni &URL;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>khelpcenter</command> <option>file:/<replaceable>usr/local/src/qt/"
"html/index.html</replaceable></option>"
msgstr ""
"<command>khelpcenter</command> <option>file:/<replaceable>usr/local/src/qt/"
"html/index.html</replaceable></option>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid "A Man page"
msgstr "Man stranica"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>khelpcenter</command> <option>man:/<replaceable>strcpy</"
"replaceable></option>"
msgstr ""
"<command>khelpcenter</command> <option>man:/<replaceable>strcpy</"
"replaceable></option>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "An Info page"
msgstr "Info stranica"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>khelpcenter</command> <option>info:/<replaceable>gcc</replaceable></"
"option>"
msgstr ""
"<command>khelpcenter</command> <option>info:/<replaceable>gcc</replaceable></"
"option>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Invoking <command>khelpcenter</command> with no parameters opens the default "
"start page."
msgstr ""
"Invoking <command>khelpcenter</command> bez parametara otvara predodređenu "
"početnu stranicu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &khelpcenter; interface"
msgstr "&khelpcenter; interfejs"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &khelpcenter; interface consists of two panes of information."
msgstr "&khelpcenter; intefejs sadrži dva panela informacija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The toolbar and menus are explained further in <xref linkend=\"menu-and-"
"toolbar-ref\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Trake alata i meniji su objašnjeni detaljnije na <xref linkend=\"menu-and-"
"toolbar-ref\"/>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Documents contain their own navigation tools, enabling you to move either "
"sequentially through a document, using <guilabel>Next</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Previous</guilabel>, and <guilabel>Contents</guilabel> links, or "
"to move around in a less structured manner, using hyperlinks."
msgstr ""
"Dokumenti sadrže svoje navidacijske alate, koji vam omogućavaju da se "
"krećete sekvencijalno kroz dokument sa <guilabel>Sledeći</guilabel>,"
"<guilabel>Prethodni</guilabel>,i <guilabel>Sadržaj</guilabel> linkovima, ili "
"da se krećete kroz manje strukturalne koristeći hiperlinkove."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Links can take you to other parts of the same document, or to a different "
"document, and you can use the <guiicon>Back</guiicon> (Left pointing arrow) "
"or <guiicon>Forward</guiicon> (Right pointing arrow) icons on the toolbar to "
"move through the documents you have viewed in this session."
msgstr ""
"Linkovi vode do drugih dijelova istog dokumenta,drugih dokumenata, i možete "
"koristiti <guiicon>Nazad</guiicon> (strelica lijevo) or <guiicon>Naprijed</"
"guiicon> (strelica desno) ikone na traci alata da se krećete kroz dokumente "
"koje ste vidjeli u ovoj sesiji."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:214
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The two panes display the contents of the help system, and the help files "
"themselves, on the left and right respectively."
msgstr ""
"Dva panela prikazuju sadržaj pomoć sistema, i pomoć fajlove, lijevo i desno "
"retrospektivno."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Contents Pane"
msgstr "Sadržaj Panel"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The contents pane in &khelpcenter; is displayed on the left hand side of the "
"window. As you might expect, you can move the splitter bar, to make sure you "
"can comfortably read the contents of either pane."
msgstr ""
"Sadržaj panel u &khelpcenter; prikazan je na lijevoj strani prozora. Naravno "
"možete pomijerati dijelitelj prozora da biste fino mogli pročitati sadržaj "
"panela."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:229
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The contents pane is further divided into two tabs, one containing a <link "
"linkend=\"contents-tab\">tree view</link> showing all the help information "
"&khelpcenter; is aware of, and the other contains the &kde; <link linkend="
"\"kde-glossary\">glossary</link> of terms."
msgstr ""
"Sadržaj panel je dalje podijeljen na dva taba, jedan sadrži <link linkend="
"\"contents-tab\">tree view</link> gdje su prikazane sve informacije za pomoć "
"kojih je  &khelpcenter; svjestan, a druga sadrži &kde; <link linkend=\"kde-"
"glossary\">glossary</link>  uslova."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Contents Tab"
msgstr "Sadržaj Tab"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Contents</guilabel> tab contains the following default top "
"level entries in the tree view:"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Sadržaj</guilabel> tab sadrži sledeće predodređene glavne unose u "
"tree view-u:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kde; Fundamentals"
msgstr "&kde; Osnove"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Fundamentals introduce you to the many features of the &kde; Software "
"Collection and describe many common tasks you can perform in all &kde; "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"Osnove vas upoznaju sa mnogim osobinama &kde; Softver klekcijom i opisuju "
"uglavnom zajedničke operacije koje možete raditi u svim &kde; aplikacijama."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plasma Manual"
msgstr "Plazma Uputstvo"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:259
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &plasma; Manual is the documentation for the most visible pillar of "
"&kde;, the core interface to the desktop."
msgstr ""
"&plasma; Uputstvo je dokumentacija za najvidljiviji stub  &kde;, srž "
"intejfejsa za desktop."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:267
#, no-c-format
msgid "Online Help"
msgstr "Online pomoć"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A page with links to online help and additional information provided by the "
"&kde; community."
msgstr ""
"Stanica sa linkovima za online pomoć i dodatnim informacijama datim od  "
"&kde; zajednice."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:275
#, no-c-format
msgid "Application Manuals"
msgstr "Aplikacija Uputstvo"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Native &kde; application documentation. All &kde; applications have "
"documentation in &XML; format, which are converted to <acronym>HTML</"
"acronym> when you view them. This section lists all the &kde; applications "
"with a brief description and a link to the full application documentation."
msgstr ""
"Bazna &kde; aplikacijska dokumentacija.Sve &kde; aplikacije imaju "
"dokumentaciju u &XML; formatu, koja se konvertuje u <acronym>HTML</acronym> "
"kada je gledate. Ova sekcije navodi sve  &kde;  aplikacije sa kratkim opisom "
"i linkom ka punom sadrzaju dokumentacije aplikacije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:284
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The applications are displayed in a tree structure that echoes the default "
"structure of the <guimenu>K</guimenu> menu, making it easy to find the "
"application you are looking for."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacije su prikazane u razgranatoj strukturi koja preslikava predodređenu "
"strukturu sa <guimenu>K</guimenu>  menija, što čini pronalazak aplikacije "
"lakšim."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid "Control Center Modules"
msgstr "Moduli Kontrolnog Centra"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:295
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Provides a list of links to various modules that are located in the &kde; "
"&systemsettings; application."
msgstr ""
"Daje listu linkova raznih modula koji su smješteni u  &kde; &systemsettings; "
"aplikaciji."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:303
#, no-c-format
msgid "KInfoCenter Modules"
msgstr "Moduli K‑infocentra"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:305
#, no-c-format
msgid "Contains a list of links to various KInfocenter modules documentation."
msgstr "Sadrži listu linkova za razne dokumentacije KInfocenter modula."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid "Kioslaves"
msgstr "Kioslaves"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:314
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Contains a list of links to various <acronym>KIO</acronym> modules "
"documentation."
msgstr "Sadrži listu raznih dokumentacija <acronym>KIO</acronym> modula."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:321
#, no-c-format
msgid "&UNIX; manual pages"
msgstr "&UNIX; stranice uputstva"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&UNIX; man pages are the traditional on-line documentation format for &UNIX; "
"systems. Most programs on your system will have a man page. In addition, man "
"pages exist for programming functions and file formats."
msgstr ""
"&UNIX; man stranice su tradicionalne on-line dokumentacijski format a &UNIX; "
"sisteme. Većina programa u sistemu ima man stranicu. Kako dodatak, man "
"stanice postoje za programske funkcije i formate fajlova."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:333
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scrollkeeper"
msgstr "Čuvar svitaka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:335
#, no-c-format
msgid "Additional non-&kde; documentation installed on your system."
msgstr "Dodatne ne-&kde; dokumentacije instalirane na vašem sistemu."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:341
#, no-c-format
msgid "Browse Info Pages"
msgstr "Pregledanje info stranica"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:343
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"TeXinfo documentation is used by many &GNU; applications, including "
"<command>gcc</command> (the C/C++ compiler), <command>emacs</command>, and "
"many others."
msgstr ""
"TeXinfo je dokumentacija korištene od vecine &GNU; aplikacija, uključujući "
"<command>gcc</command> (the C/C++ compiler), <command>emacs</command>, i "
"mnoge druge."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:454
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <application>Man</application> and <application>Info</application> "
"sections"
msgstr ""
"<application>Man</application>i <application>Info</application> sekcije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:457
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Man pages are the standard &UNIX; manual pages, and have been in use for "
"many years on many operating systems. They are extremely thorough, and are "
"the very best place to get information about most &UNIX; commands and "
"applications. When people say <quote>RTFM</quote>, the Manual they are "
"referring to is very often the man page."
msgstr ""
"Man stranice su standardne &UNIX; stranice uputstva, i koriste se mnogo "
"godina na većini operativnih sistema. Jako su opširne, tako da su najbolje "
"mjesto gdje možete dobiti informacije o većini &UNIX;  komandi i aplikacija. "
"Kada ljudi kažu <quote>RTFM</quote>, uputsvo na koje misle je uglovanom man "
"stranica."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:464
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The man pages are not perfect. They tend to be in depth, but also extremely "
"technical, often written by developers, and for developers. In some cases "
"this makes them somewhat unfriendly, if not downright impossible for many "
"users to understand. They are, however, the best source of solid information "
"on most command line applications, and very often the only source."
msgstr ""
"Man stranice nisu savršene. Teže biti detaljne, ali su također i jako "
"stručne, jer ih pišu diveloperi za druge divelopere. Sto ih čini teškim za "
"razumiti za korisnike. Iako su doduše najbolji izvor informacija za komande "
"i aplikacije, ponekad i jedini."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:471
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you've ever wondered what the number is when people write things like "
"man(1) it means which section of the manual the item is in. You will see "
"&khelpcenter; uses the numbers to divide the very many man pages into their "
"own sections, making it easier for you to find the information you're "
"looking for, if you're just browsing."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste se pitali sta znači broj kada ljudi napišu man(1). Ovaj broj obično "
"predstavlja sekciju uputstva gdje se nalazi element. Vidjet ćete da "
"&khelpcenter; koristi borojeve da podijeli same man stranice na sekcije, da "
"biste lakše pronašli informacije koje tražite."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:477
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Also available are the Info pages, intended to be a replacement for the man "
"pages. The maintainer of some applications no longer update the man pages, "
"so if there is both a man page and an info page available, the info page is "
"probably the most recent. Most applications have one or the other though. If "
"the application you are looking for help on is a &GNU; utility, you will "
"most likely find it has an info page, not a man page."
msgstr ""
"Također dostupne su i Info stranice, kao zamjena za man stranice. Održavač "
"nekih aplikacija ne apdejtuje man stranice, tako da ako postoji i man i info "
"stranica, šanse su da je info stranica novija. Većina aplikacija ipak ima "
"samo jednu ili drugu. Ako je aplikacija koju tražite na &GNU; utility, "
"vidjet ćete da ima info stranicu a ne man stranicu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:486
#, no-c-format
msgid "Navigating inside the <application>Info</application> pages"
msgstr "Navigacija unutar <application>Info</application> stranica"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:488
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Info documents are arranged hierarchically with each page called a node. All "
"info documents have a <guilabel>Top</guilabel> node, &ie; the opening page. "
"You can return to the <guilabel>Top</guilabel> of an info document by "
"pressing <guilabel>Top</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Info dokumenti su poredani hijerarhijski a svaka stranica se zove čvor. Svi "
"info dokumenti imaju <guilabel>Vrh</guilabel>  čvor,&ie; početna stranica. "
"Možete se vratiti na <guilabel>Vrh</guilabel> info dokumenta pritiskom na "
"<guilabel>Vrh</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:494
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>Prev</guibutton> &amp; <guibutton>Next</guibutton> are used to "
"move to the previous/next page at the current level of the hierarchy."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>Prethodna</guibutton> &amp; <guibutton>Sledeća</guibutton>  se "
"koriste da se pređe na prethodnu/sledeću stranicu zavisno od mjesta u "
"hijerarhiji."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:498
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking on a menu item within a document moves you to a lower level in the "
"hierarchy. You may move up the hierarchy by pressing <guibutton>Up</"
"guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Klikanjem na meni element unutar dokumenta pomijera vas niže u hijerarhiji. "
"Više možete ići pritiskom na <guibutton>Gore</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:502
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Man is treated similarly to info, with the section index being the Top node "
"and each man page on the level below. Man entries are one page long."
msgstr ""
"Man se tretira slični kao info, stim da je sekcijski indeks Vrh čvor a svaka "
"stranica je nivo ispod. Svaki man unos je velik jednu stranicu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:510
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &kde; glossary"
msgstr "&kde; rječnik"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:512
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The glossary provides a quick reference point, where you can look up the "
"definitions of words that may be unfamiliar to you. These range from &kde; "
"specific applications and technologies, through to general &UNIX; computing "
"terms."
msgstr ""
"Rječnik pruža brzu referentnu tačku, gdje možete pogledati definicije vama "
"nepoznatih riječi. Od &kde; specifičnih aplikacija i tehnologija do opštih "
"&UNIX;  kompjuterskih termina."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:519
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the left hand pane you will see a tree view, with two choices: "
"<guilabel>Alphabetically</guilabel> or <guilabel>By Topic</guilabel>. Both "
"contain the same entries, sorted differently, to allow you to quickly find "
"the item of interest."
msgstr ""
"U lijevom panelu vidjet ćete tree view, sa dva izbora:<guilabel>Alfabetski</"
"guilabel> ili <guilabel>Tematski</guilabel>.Oboje sadrži isti sadržaj ali "
"drugačije sortiran,radi lakšeg pretraživanja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:526
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Navigate down the tree views to the left, and items you select will be "
"displayed on the right."
msgstr ""
"Navigirajte prema dole u tree view-u sa lijeve strane, a elementi će biti "
"prikazani desno."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:534
#, no-c-format
msgid "The menus and toolbar"
msgstr "Meniji i Trake alata"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:536
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&khelpcenter; has a very minimal interface, allowing you to concentrate on "
"getting help rather than learning how to use the help browser."
msgstr ""
"&khelpcenter; ima jednostavan interfejst, koji vam omogućava da se "
"skoncentrišete na ono što vam tebe prije nego da shvatite kako koristiti "
"pretraživač za pomoć."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:541
#, no-c-format
msgid "The icons available to you in the toolbar are as follows:"
msgstr "Ikone dostupne vama na traci alata su:"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:546
#, no-c-format
msgid "Toolbar Icons"
msgstr "Ikone alatne trake"

#. Tag: guiicon
#: index.docbook:549
#, no-c-format
msgid "Table of Contents"
msgstr "Tabele Sadržaja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:551 index.docbook:766
#, no-c-format
msgid "Go to the main start page of &khelpcenter;."
msgstr "Idi na glavnu početnu stranicu  &khelpcenter;."

#. Tag: guiicon
#: index.docbook:558
#, no-c-format
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Nazad"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:560
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Go to the previous page you viewed. Click the check mark right to the icon. "
"This displays a list of previously viewed pages. Selecting one will take you "
"directly back to that page."
msgstr ""
"Idi na prethodno posjećenu stranicu. Klikni na kvačicu pored ikone. "
"Prikazana je lista prethodno pogledanih stranica. Izaberi onu na koju želiš "
"da se vratiš direktno."

#. Tag: guiicon
#: index.docbook:569
#, no-c-format
msgid "Forward"
msgstr "Naprijed"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:571
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Go forward one page. This icon is only active if you have already used the "
"<guiicon>Back</guiicon> icon."
msgstr ""
"Idite naprijed jednu stranicu. Ova ikona je aktivna samo ako ste prije "
"koristili <guiicon>Nazad</guiicon> ikonu."

#. Tag: guiicon
#: index.docbook:588
#, no-c-format
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Kopiraj"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:590
#, no-c-format
msgid "Copy text to the clipboard to be pasted in another application."
msgstr ""
"Kopiraj tekst u klipbord da bi se poslije mogao lijepiti u drugim "
"aplikacijama."

#. Tag: guiicon
#: index.docbook:597
#, no-c-format
msgid "Find"
msgstr "Pronađi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:599
#, no-c-format
msgid "Find a word or words within the currently visible page."
msgstr "Pronađi riječ ili riječi unutar trenutno vidljive stranice."

#. Tag: guiicon
#: index.docbook:606
#, no-c-format
msgid "Increase Font Sizes"
msgstr "Povećaj veličinu fonta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:608
#, no-c-format
msgid "Increase the size of the text in the viewer pane."
msgstr "Povećava veličinu fonta u panelu za pregled."

#. Tag: guiicon
#: index.docbook:615
#, no-c-format
msgid "Decrease Font Sizes"
msgstr "Smanji veličinu fonta"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:617
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Decrease the size of the text in the viewer pane. This icon is only enabled "
"if you have previously enlarged the text."
msgstr ""
"Smanjuje veličinu teksta u panelu za pregled. Ikona je omogućena ako ste "
"prije toga povećali veličinu teksta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:626
#, no-c-format
msgid "The menus contain the following entries:"
msgstr "Ovaj meni sadrži sledeće unose:"

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:632
#, no-c-format
msgid "File"
msgstr "Fajl"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:639
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>P</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Print</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>P</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Fajl</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Printaj</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:648
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Print the contents of the currently visible page. Handbooks in <acronym>PDF</"
"acronym> format you find on the <ulink url=\"http://docs.kde.org/index.php?"
"language=en\"> &kde; Documentation Server</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Printa sadržaj trenutno vidljive stranice. Priručnike u <acronym>PDF</"
"acronym> formatu koje ste našli na  <ulink url=\"http://docs.kde.org/index."
"php?language=en\"> &kde; Documentation Server</ulink>."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:657
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Fajl</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Prekini</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:666
#, no-c-format
msgid "Close and exit &khelpcenter;"
msgstr "Zatvori i napusti &khelpcenter;"

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:678
#, no-c-format
msgid "Edit"
msgstr "Izmijeni"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:684
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Copy</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Izmijeni</guimenu><guimenuitem>Kopiraj</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:692
#, no-c-format
msgid "Copy the selected text to the clipboard."
msgstr "Kopiraj odabrani tekst na klipbord."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:699
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>A</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Select All</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>A</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Izmijeni</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Odaberi Sve</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:706
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select all the text in the current page."
msgstr "Odabira sav tekst sa trenutne stranice."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:713
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>F</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Find...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>F</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Izmijeni</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Pronađi...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:720
#, no-c-format
msgid "Find a word or words in the currently visible page."
msgstr "Traži riječ ili riječi na trenutno vidljivoj stranici."

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:732
#, no-c-format
msgid "View"
msgstr "Prikaz"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:737
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Set Encoding</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Prikaz</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Postavi Kodiranje</guisubmenu>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:742
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Change the encoding of the current page. Normally, the default setting of "
"<guimenuitem>Default</guimenuitem> should be sufficient, but if you are "
"having problems viewing pages written in languages other than English, you "
"may need to choose a specific encoding in this menu."
msgstr ""
"Mijenja kodiranje trenutne stranice.Obično, predodređena postavka iz "
"<guimenuitem>Predodređeno</guimenuitem> bi trebala biti dovoljna, aki ako "
"imate problema sa pregledom stranica na drugim jezicima, treba li biste "
"koristiti ovu opciju."

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:757
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Go</guimenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Idi</guimenu>"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:761
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>Home</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Go</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Table of Contents</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>Početna</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Idi</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Tabele Sadržaja</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:773
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>PgUp</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Go</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Previous Page</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>PgUp</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Idi</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Prethodna Stranica</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:778
#, no-c-format
msgid "Go to the previous page of the current documentation."
msgstr "Ide na prethodnu stranicu dokumenta."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:785
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>PgDown</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Go</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Next Page</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>PgDown</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Idi</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Sledeća stranica</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:790
#, no-c-format
msgid "Go to the next page of the current documentation."
msgstr "Ide na sledeću stranicu trenutnog dokumenta."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:797
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keysym>Left</keysym></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Go</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Back</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keysym>Left</keysym></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Idi</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Nazad</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:802
#, no-c-format
msgid "Go back to the previous page you were viewing."
msgstr "Ide na poslednju stranicu koju ste gledali."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:807
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keysym>Right</keysym></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Go</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Forward</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keysym>Right</keysym></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Idi</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Naprijed</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:813
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have previously moved back with the back icon or menu entry, you can "
"work your way forward again with this menu entry."
msgstr "Ako ste se prije vratili nazad, sada se možete \"vratiti\" naprijed."

#. Tag: guimenu
#: index.docbook:829
#, no-c-format
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Postavke"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:835
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure Fonts...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Konfiguriši Fontove...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:841
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allows you to configure the font family and size used by &khelpcenter;."
msgstr ""
"Omogućuje da konfigurišete familije fontova i njihovu veličinu sa "
"&khelpcenter;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:866
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &khelpcenter; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"and <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the "
"sections about the <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings"
"\">Settings Menu</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-"
"help\">Help Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Dodatno &khelpcenter; ima obične &kde; <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu>  "
"<guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> meni elemente, za više informacija pročitajte  "
"<ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Postake Meni</"
"ulink> i <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Pomoć Meni</"
"ulink> sa &kde; Osnove."

